    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d370-a1">

                <pb facs="0563" n="469" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg469"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 224.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Dr. Cochran to Mr.
                            McDonald.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-01-20"><hi rendition="#small-caps">January</hi>, 20,
                            1896</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I beg to inform you that our citizens in Van want to be brought away from that
                    city. It is, however, necessary to have some horsemen to accompany Howard to
                    fetch the ladies and to protect them on the road. Reply.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cochran.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
